Hi Stefan,

If possible, I would love to see more examples on UTF8-encoding languages, such as Mandarin. Encoding is always a confusing problem when dealing with texts from non-programmers. It would even be better if some examples could be based on other non-English corpora with respect to regular-expression-based retrievals. Also, for English specifically, is it possible to include examples of preprocesssing, such as lemmatization, stemmization, POS-tagging etc. (i.e., things that can easily be done with Python in NLTK ).

Really looking forward to your second edition!

Cheers,

*****
